# Modern GUI toolkits (e.g., Qt6 in VirtualBox 7.2+) and media stacks
# now enforce a hybrid backend model. 
# - 'X' is required for legacy compatibility and XWayland support.
# - 'wayland' is increasingly mandated by ebuilds as a REQUIRED_USE 
#   dependency for toolkit initialization, even when running under X11.
# This dual-flag setup ensures broad hardware acceleration support 
# and prevents dependency backtracking in rolling-release profiles.
USE="
  X
  wayland
"
